{"ID":"20230925154716-05e36fd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154716-05e36fd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154716-05e36fd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154722-2vs8t5i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927112740-kgobqzh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927112740-kgobqzh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【续命汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927112740"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154722-2vs8t5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154722-2vs8t5i","updated":"20230925154722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：麻黄、桂枝、当归、人参、石膏、干姜、甘草各三两、川穹一两、杏仁四十枚"}]},{"ID":"20230925154722-apusw8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154722-apusw8a","updated":"20230925154722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上九味，以水一斗，煮取四声，温服一升，当小汗，薄覆脊，凭几坐，汗出即愈；不汗，更服。无所禁，勿当风。并治但伏不得卧，咳逆上气，面目浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154722-p99ovya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154722-p99ovya","updated":"20230925154722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《古今录验》续命汤：治中风痱，身体不能自收持，口不能言，冒昧不知痛处，或拘急不得转侧。姚云：与大续命同，兼治妇从产后出血者，及老人小儿。"}]},{"ID":"20230927112740-kgobqzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927112740-kgobqzh"}}]}